// Conformance fixture for ta.roc (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.37, Wave 5B-4).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed by
// hand-executing 100 * (source - source[length]) / source[length]
// against a hard-coded synthetic close series (see ta_roc.csv `close`
// column).
//
// Fixture length = 3. Warmup: first 3 bars are NA (source[length] is
// not yet defined). No zero-divisor in this fixture — source stays
// well above 100 for the entire run.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_roc", overlay=false)
plot(ta.roc(close, 3), title="roc3")
